  portugueseText: "Marco e Rafael entram novamente no beco onde o pesadelo come\xE7ou.
    Mas quando se aproximam do v\xF3rtice que viram anteriormente, os dois s\xE3o
    paralisados por ele, e come\xE7am a ter mais uma vis\xE3o. "
  englishText: Marco and Rafael re-enter the alley where the nightmare began. But
    as they approach the vortex they saw earlier, they are both paralyzed by it and
    begin to have yet another vision.
